(From: Marcus Bell <mbell@tollerby-freight.example>) Tj T*
(Sent: Friday, April 4, 2025 5:02 PM) Tj T*
(To: Depot Managers <depot-managers@tollerby-freight.example>) Tj T*
(Subject: Q2 depot plan) Tj T*
T*
(All,) Tj T*
T*
(Thanks for the Q1 numbers. Here is the plan for the second quarter, so you can set your) Tj T*
(rotas now.) Tj T*
T*
(Brayford Park moves to two loading slots a day from April 14, at 06:00 and 13:00. Bay 4) Tj T*
(reopens on April 7 after the resurfacing, and Bay 2 goes back to returns only. The new) Tj T*
(pallet scanners arrive in the week of April 21; each depot gets two, and the yard office) Tj T*
(will book the training. Overtime stays capped at six hours a week per driver until the new) Tj T*
(rota settles. Please send me your holiday plans for May and June by April 18, and flag any) Tj T*
(week where you would be short of drivers or forklift cover. The quarterly safety walk is) Tj T*
(on May 9 at every depot, starting at 10:00, and I would like each of you to lead the one) Tj T*
(on your own site.) Tj T*
T*
(One more thing, on Kestrel. Our General Counsel has advised that the February delivery) Tj T*
(logs may be needed as evidence in their claim against us. Do not delete or edit them, and) Tj T*
(send any question about the claim to him before you reply to anyone at Kestrel. His advice) Tj T*
(on our position is for the management team only, so please do not forward this paragraph.) Tj T*
T*
(Marcus) Tj T*
